[38;2;203;166;247mKeys[39m
[38;2;180;190;254mj, down[39m  move the cursor one row down
[38;2;180;190;254mk, up[39m    move the cursor one row up
[38;2;180;190;254mn[39m        move to the next unseen row after the cursor, wrapping around
[38;2;180;190;254m/[39m        start filter input. Typed text sets the filter. Backspace deletes its last character, Enter
         keeps the filter, and Esc clears it
[38;2;180;190;254menter[39m    switch the client to the row's pane, mark the pane seen, and close the tree
[38;2;180;190;254mx[39m        mark the row's pane seen; the tree stays open
[38;2;180;190;254mc[39m        add a window running `claude` to the row's session, started in the row's directory; the
         tree stays open
[38;2;180;190;254ms[39m        open the shell popup for the row's directory, and close the tree
[38;2;180;190;254mN[39m        close the tree and run the picker for the row's directory; the picker's choice switches the
         client
[38;2;180;190;254mX[39m        close the row's pane after a y/N prompt, asking twice for a working Claude pane
[38;2;180;190;254mD[39m        close every session of the row's project and its shell session after a prompt listing them
[38;2;180;190;254m?[39m        show every key
[38;2;180;190;254mesc, q[39m   close the tree
